      "content": "it's not even scary though. that's the weird part. looking out at that drop, at the way the fog just swallows everything... it feels almost peaceful. like the heavy walking is finally over. there's a certain kind of beauty in just admitting the path has ended, isn't there? like a story that finally reaches its natural, quiet conclusion.",
